Write a Java program to represent a collection of DVDs using a class and an array.
  class DVD{
    String title;
    int releseyear;
    String Director;

    DVD(String t, int y, String D) {

        title = t;
        releseyear =y;
        Director =D;


    }

    public String toString() {
        return title + "("+releseyear+"), Directed by" + Director;


    }
}
